<https://example.org/levin-kg/weightOfEvidence_deciban> owl:equivalentProperty delphi:weightOfEvidenceDeciban .
<https://example.org/levin-kg/calibrationMethod>        owl:equivalentProperty delphi:calibrationMethod .
<https://example.org/levin-kg/bayesFactorCombined>      owl:equivalentProperty delphi:bayesFactor .
