<https://example.org/levin-kg/pValue>                   owl:equivalentProperty delphi:pValue .
<https://example.org/levin-kg/statisticalTest>          owl:equivalentProperty delphi:statisticalTest .
<https://example.org/levin-kg/context>                  owl:equivalentProperty delphi:context .
